  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "878a0015f8ae4dc4",
      "translationZh": "过去这几天，我和 Opus 5.5 一起，在 Inco 出色且本就快得惊人的 Splash 引擎的一个分叉版本上开展工作，针对 M5 Max 芯片进行优化。我擅自给它起了个名字，叫 Splish。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "316946022fe328ea",
      "translationZh": "这与 u/Erp4759 出色的 M1 移植版（Splash on M1, part 2）大致是相反的方向。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc6818e9d4a5b8c5",
      "translationZh": "图表（原版 Splash 与 Splish 对比）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8b828f16c792f43",
      "translationZh": "在同一台 Mac 上使用相同模型，与原样发布的 Splash 1.1.0 相比，Splish 的表现如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e464d9a5314d123",
      "translationZh": "单个请求时，速度约为原版的 1.25×（提升 +11% 至 +35%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b5081efc168b5b5",
      "translationZh": "2–4 个请求时，速度最高可达原版的 1.5×",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a567bdcdc63dcfe",
      "translationZh": "在我测量的所有项目上，质量都没有变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55a8e0f3c0aacc23",
      "translationZh": "在实际使用中，在 Deepseek Harness 中使用短篇故事提示词时，速度从约 45-51 tok/s 提升到了 56 - 64 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed27c8c790abf3a7",
      "translationZh": "除非另有说明，所有数据均基于在 40 核 M5 Max 上运行的 4 位模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad628e77d7b94c30",
      "translationZh": "使用 Splash 自带的调优器，专门针对 40 核 M5 Max 测量并选定的内核配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9abae55175fbb697",
      "translationZh": "调优器位于 Splash 的源代码中，但未包含在打包的应用中。这带来了最大的单请求性能提升：Swift-1.5 从 74.7 → 89.8 tok/s（+20%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "befccfe7d59208b6",
      "translationZh": "从文件加载这些配置（SPLASH_KERNEL_CHOICES）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0dce035e1dfe049",
      "translationZh": "这本身不会带来加速，但意味着任何人都可以在无需重新构建的情况下重新调优。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e419b423a340b1d9",
      "translationZh": "面向 M5 张量单元的新验证内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9f7bae0a2bc5092",
      "translationZh": "这些内核使用开销更低的同步屏障，并在每次投影时只计算一次行和：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df83e3deed146a9a",
      "translationZh": "在 2–4 个请求时提升 +10–19%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2bf898a1703fb38",
      "translationZh": "将相同的内核扩展到更多投影运算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b505fa391a10da81",
      "translationZh": "在 3–4 个请求下进一步提速 1–3%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53be83da27a4ee1a",
      "translationZh": "结合 #3 和 #4，在 2 / 3 / 4 个请求下，单个解码步骤的速度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3051a26fe9d14c7",
      "translationZh": "达到调优后的 Splash 的 1.32× / 1.49× / 1.36×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59725a5eec8e0bad",
      "translationZh": "使用新内核调优 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdeea606ffe7f5ba",
      "translationZh": "在 1–4 个请求下的加速效果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c897ec1cdc8f5d26",
      "translationZh": "针对 27B 形状的注意力微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59b811fe846dff71",
      "translationZh": "注意力计算提速 2–3%，提示词处理提速 3–4%。提升太小，未能体现在整体数据中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9befa335e293467a",
      "translationZh": "GGUF（Q8_0, Q4_K_M, Q6_K）：解码内核中的输入加载更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f1667138a3b1736",
      "translationZh": "每个内核提升 +2–14%，每步提升约 +2%。输出逐位完全一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a45f4ceb8b92433b",
      "translationZh": "一条用于编程智能体的复制规则，借鉴自 TensorFold。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f68ff1a0563acc16",
      "translationZh": "当模型重写它已经见过的文本时，草稿会逐字复制这些文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f393e42d51ad0e0",
      "translationZh": "整文件编辑提升 +24% 到 +42%，而其他所有操作的变化都保持在 ±3% 以内，且输出完全一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e598de8f8d317ee",
      "translationZh": "我正在探索一种互补的方法，用于未来的版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc8d1422eb9a0ee8",
      "translationZh": "README 还列出了所有对我而言行不通的尝试；如果有人想避免陷入同样的死胡同，这些内容大概会很有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2673f4a75bfdc9cd",
      "translationZh": "我还想测试很多东西，但觉得这已经是个不错的开始了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f329b6ad08fbfc02",
      "translationZh": "这些经过调优的设置适用于 40 核 M5 Max。其他 M5 芯片会回退到 Splash 的默认设置，除非手动覆盖。自动调优器即将推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "181a889bdb79728a",
      "translationZh": "如果你运行它，python3 dev/m5/report.py 会打印一份性能报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00dbd7bd30a0ce84",
      "translationZh": "非常欢迎提供其他机器上的运行结果，尤其是你发现它运行得更慢的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f37ac68c74b374c8",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/SeveralViolins 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
